00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.535
-Welcome back, guys.
It is time for...

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.104
♪♪
"Tonight...Show" --

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:06.806
[ Laughter ]

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.641
-Wow!
-Gosh!

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.143
-Sorry!
-You on a time crunch?

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.377
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:12.678
-He got places to go.

00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:14.013
-I know. We got things to do.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:15.881
I was gonna say,
guys, welcome back.

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:19.685
It's time for
"Tonight Show" hashtags.

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:20.987
♪ -Hashtags ♪

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:23.990 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.226
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:28.628
-Oh.

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:30.463
Thank you, guys.

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:33.232
Now, we do this thing every week
where I send out a hashtag,

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:35.167
and I ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.704
Since we are in the middle of
wedding season,

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.939 line:0%
I sent out the hashtag
#WeddingFail,

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.975 line:0%
and I asked you guys
to share the craziest story

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.676 line:0%
from a wedding
that you've attended.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:47.146 line:0%
Within minutes it was a trending
topic across the country,

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:48.881 line:0%
so thank you for playing along.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:51.117 line:0%
I love it when you play this.
We do it every week.

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.887 line:0%
So now I'd like to share some of
my favorite #WeddingFail

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.688 line:0%
responses from you guys.
These are good.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:57.623
This first one is
from @keepnitfun.

00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.125
-Oh, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.461
-They say, "The photographer
at my mom's wedding

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.663
backed into a candle
and caught fire.

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.499
My grandma shouted,
'Honey, your hair is on fire.'

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.634
My grandpa thought
she was alerting him,

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:11.770
took his toupee off, threw it
on the floor and stomped it."

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.706
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.675
Wow!

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:17.109
-That's a three-layer cake!

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:20.513
-That is like a -- That's
a Three Stooges movie, man.

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.681
-Nyah, nyah, nyah.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:24.683
-This one is
from @jwilliams1027.

00:01:24.683 --> 00:01:26.986
He says, "I officiated a wedding
for a couple

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:28.220
I had never met before.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.489
It was 100 degrees
and the wedding was outside.

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:32.292
Just as the bride was
walking down the aisle,

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.194
my iPad overheated and shut off.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:35.829
I had to do the whole thing
without notes

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:37.396
and/or knowing their names."

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:38.464
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:41.867
Uh, do you...

00:01:41.867 --> 00:01:44.403
Do you take...
-Him to be her?

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:45.605
-Do you...

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:46.906
Do you take --

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:47.907
Right, what would you say?

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:51.477
What would you say?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:53.612
Yes? I d--

00:01:53.612 --> 00:01:55.915
You would say -- No?

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:59.919
Ed? Of course.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:03.155
This one's from @notoriousrw3.

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:06.158
They say, "At my wedding,
my best man started his speech

00:02:06.158 --> 00:02:08.894
with 'You all probably recognize
me from the first wedding.'"

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:10.997
[ Audience oohs ]
-Oh!

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:15.068
Ouch!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:18.270
-That's not bad. Come on.
That's funny.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.973
This one is from @savageron.
-Ooh!

00:02:20.973 --> 00:02:24.076
-He says, "My wife and I went to
a wedding and the reception room

00:02:24.076 --> 00:02:27.046
had no tables for guests to sit
at, but there were chairs

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:30.149
still arranged in circles
as if there were tables.

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:32.752
So at least we could stare at
each other while awkwardly

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:35.454
holding our plates of food,
trying not to laugh."

00:02:35.454 --> 00:02:37.690
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:40.526
I can't believe you sat me
next to --

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:42.896
No table.
-Where's the table truck?

00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:44.197
The what?

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:47.166
-This one is from @tslouch.

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:50.903
They say, "A buddy got an invite
to his ex-fiancée's wedding with

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:53.273
the 'Will Not Attend'
already checked off."

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:56.442
-Ooh.
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:59.946
Burn!
-Burn notice.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.348
This one is from @jubjub315.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:04.650
-Aw, I love jubjub.
-That's a good name.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:05.918
-Jubjub.
-Jubjub, yep.

00:03:05.918 --> 00:03:08.687
-What's up, jubjub?
-Not much.

00:03:08.687 --> 00:03:11.657
He says, "As the best man,
I had to keep the groom

00:03:11.657 --> 00:03:14.394
from getting cold feet, so I
told him that their relationship

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.195
was stronger than
specific couples

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:18.797
that were at the wedding,
forgetting I was miked up.

00:03:18.797 --> 00:03:20.399
It got picked up
through the speakers."

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:24.403
[ Audience oohs ]

00:03:24.403 --> 00:03:26.439
-Oh.
-Not necessarily you guys.

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:28.875
-Jubjub.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.510
-Jubjub in troub-troub.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.179
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:35.114
That's my new sitcom, dude.
-Yeah.

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:37.550
-"Jubjub in Troub-Troub," yeah.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:43.656
This one is
from @tomgall61097924.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:45.224
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.224 --> 00:03:47.560
It's an easy follow on Twitter.
-Yeah, easy.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.862
-How come you never
direct message me?

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.664
Never follow me or anything?
-Well, what's your handle?

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:52.765
I'll do it right now.
-Tomgall.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:53.766
-Yeah? Okay, great.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:54.834
-6.
-Wait.

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:56.635
-Tomgall61.

00:03:56.635 --> 00:03:58.304
-61.

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:00.339
-0.

00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:01.707
9.
-9.

00:04:01.707 --> 00:04:03.642
-7.
-7. Okay, that's done.

00:04:03.642 --> 00:04:05.578
-9.
-Okay, 9. Another 9.

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.513
My screen went black.
-2.

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.415
[ Laughter ]
-Hold on.

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:12.418
-He says, "It was my wedding,
and we had my wife

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:14.754
take a picture on a horse
with me holding it.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:17.423
The horse got so scared of
my wife's crunching dress

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:19.191
that it just wouldn't let her on
no matter what we did,

00:04:19.191 --> 00:04:21.961
so I had to jump on the top
with my wife holding the horse."

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:24.764
But he sent us the picture.
Look at the picture.

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:27.433
Ah!
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:29.601
That's the funniest thing.
[ Applause ]

00:04:29.601 --> 00:04:31.136
[ Laughs ]

00:04:31.136 --> 00:04:33.038
Just cut the horse.

00:04:33.038 --> 00:04:34.774
-Yeah, just get the horse out.
-Let's just cut the horse.

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:36.575
-We paid for the horse.

00:04:36.575 --> 00:04:39.579
-Let's just not do it.
I can't have you on the horse.

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:41.414
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:43.316
-You know who would have gotten
on that horse? Jubjub.

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:45.918
-Of course. Classic.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.918 --> 00:04:48.687
This one's from @marisarosie22.

00:04:48.687 --> 00:04:50.990
She says, "My friend's
mother-in-law brought platters

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.759
of food to a catered wedding
reception so their side of

00:04:53.759 --> 00:04:56.228
the family would 'have something
to eat that they liked.'"

00:04:56.228 --> 00:04:58.097
[ Audience oohs ]

00:04:58.097 --> 00:04:59.332
-Ouch!

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:00.766
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:03.936
-Oh, my gosh. That is fun.

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:06.138
This one from @charliehenn.

00:05:06.138 --> 00:05:09.074
He says, "To save money, I had
a cousin videotape our wedding.

00:05:09.074 --> 00:05:10.809
The next day he visited the zoo

00:05:10.809 --> 00:05:12.712
and taped over
the entire ceremony.

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:15.581
Our video consists of elephants
and orangutans followed by

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:17.016
a hard cut to the reception

00:05:17.016 --> 00:05:19.184
with everyone doing the Macarena
on the dance floor."

00:05:19.184 --> 00:05:24.656
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:24.656 --> 00:05:27.893
This one is from @ashinrangani.

00:05:27.893 --> 00:05:30.596
He says, "I gave
my friends weapons."

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:32.264
But then he shared the video.

00:05:32.264 --> 00:05:35.934
Look at this rice
getting tossed here.

00:05:35.934 --> 00:05:37.470
Ow!

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:40.606
Wait, there's one --
Look at this one coming up.

00:05:40.606 --> 00:05:42.208
Boom!
-Oh!

00:05:42.208 --> 00:05:43.876
-Oh, my gosh!

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:47.547
Congratulations!
So happy for you!

00:05:47.547 --> 00:05:50.349
[ Laughter ]

00:05:50.349 --> 00:05:52.351
This last one --
Oh, this is great.

00:05:52.351 --> 00:05:54.353
This is from @jakewilliamsart.

00:05:54.353 --> 00:05:56.488
He says, "Went to a wedding
where the best man thought

00:05:56.488 --> 00:05:58.524
it would be funny to French kiss
an ice sculpture

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:00.259
with the bride and groom's name
on it.

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:02.227
He only got unstuck
after his friend

00:06:02.227 --> 00:06:04.063
poured some hot soup
around his tongue."

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:05.564
[ Laughter ]
There you go, everybody.

00:06:05.564 --> 00:06:07.633
